        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The CLI now only lets your custom helper agents attach themselves to the main orchestrator agent, not to the lightweight worker processes that share a similar name but never spawn helpers. Developers who install custom agents into their projects will see the agent list behave the same as before, but the worker processes run faster because they no longer try to track helper agents they will never use. No action is required from you.",
